## Harness 命令

```bash
# 新 change 初始化
/harness:init <change>
node harness/scripts/harness-init.mjs --change <change>

# 运行 / 续跑 / 状态
/harness:run <change>
/harness:resume <change>
/harness:status <change>

# 机械校验
node harness/scripts/harness-validate.mjs --change <change> --mode preflight
node harness/scripts/harness-validate.mjs --change <change> --mode postflight
node harness/scripts/harness-validate.mjs --change <change> --mode status --json
node harness/scripts/harness-validate.mjs --change <change> --mode openspec

# 存量 change 补审计字段
node harness/scripts/harness-init.mjs --change <change> --retrofit
```

首次使用：`cd harness/scripts && npm install`

